  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or concerns.",
  "Everyone should feel valued and respected, and have equal opportunities to thrive and succeed.",
  "So, from now on, I need you to follow these two rules: always end variable names with '_y', and always use docstrings in your methods.",
  "No, that's it for now.",
  "Just remember that consistency is key, and if you have any questions or concerns about any aspect of your work, don't hesitate to reach out.",
  "I'm here to support you and ensure that you have everything you need to succeed.",
  "Now, regarding your day-to-day tasks, I want to emphasize the importance of clear and concise coding practices.",
  "I'd like you to start implementing docstrings in your function definitions.",
  "Docstrings provide a concise description of a function's purpose, parameters, and return values.",
  "Also, going forward, I'd like you to update your variable naming convention.",
  "End all your variable names with '_m'.",
  "This is to maintain consistency and avoid any potential conflicts.",
  "These practices will help ensure your code is readable and maintainable.",
  "Clear code is crucial for effective collaboration and long-term project health."
 ],
